    -     en: 'For body text “abababa”, quote “aba” starts at UTF-16 positions 0, 2 and 4. occurrence 2 names position 2; overlapping ambiguity is not repaired by switching occurrences. For current item 0 body: {intent:"current",item:0,unit:"body",source:null,quote:"aba",occurrence:2}. A receipt uses unit:"receipt",source:0 and only that delivered excerpt.',
