        0: 'Hash-verify the paid ledger and immutable configuration at snapshotOrdinal; fake/simulated transport usage is inadmissible. Reconcile every request/charge; deduplicate provider request IDs.'
        1: 'Pilot has all 60 families and 240/480 attempted logical calls, including incomplete/failed answers. Usage includes every settled transport attempt, not just successful answers. Validate chargedNanodollars from full billed input/output usage and frozen rates.'
        2: 'No development/test/alternative dispatch has occurred: their settled totals and outstanding lists are zero at this pre-development gate. All cumulative spending, including paid engineering activity, is included in settledNanodollarsByStage.'
        3: 'Verify each outstanding reservation against the ledger body/model/input/output bounds. Retain its full unknown charge. Embedding reserved units include every attempt, settled or outstanding; retries never receive fresh allowances.'
